  "type": "singleCorrect",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "<div>Which of the following is the correct order of stability of conformations for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mi>OH</mi></math>.</div>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "bYR7d",
      "text": "<div>gauche <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#62;</mo></math> eclipsed <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#62;</mo></math> anti</div>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "gCnnw",
      "text": "gauche <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#62;</mo></math> anti <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#62;</mo></math> eclipsed",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "4vXBS",
      "text": "eclipsed <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#62;</mo></math> gauche <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#62;</mo></math> anti",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "6UxQc",
      "text": "anti <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#62;</mo></math> eclipsed <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#62;</mo></math> gauche",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The anti conformation is most stable in which <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>OH</mi></math> groups are far apart as possible and minimum repulsion between two groups occurs.</p><p>In fully eclipsed conformation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>OH</mi></math> groups are so close that the steric strain is maximum.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/4ef874f7-b82c-45e9-b3d6-c5d2670bf826-d2b47552-9c8d-4ca1-9836-ff525f6ae662-QWW.png\" style=\"width: 513px; height: 219px;\" /></p><p>Since, gauche form is stabilised by intermolecular hydrogen bonding, hence it is more stable than anti.</p>",
    "image": null
  },
